---
// Roadmap.astro: Protocol engineering trajectory milestones
---

<section
  id="roadmap"
  class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/90 py-20"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 space-y-12">
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span
        class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400"
      >
        Protocol Trajectory
      </span>
      <h2
        class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl font-outfit text-[var(--text-fluid-title)]"
      >
        Sovereignty Roadmap
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-400 font-light text-[var(--text-fluid-body)]">
        The engineering release pipeline for Tadpole OS local multi-agent
        swarm orchestration.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
      <!-- Q1 -->
      <div
        class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-emerald-500/30 space-y-3"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between text-emerald-400 font-bold"
        >
          <span>Q1 2026</span>
          <span
            class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-[10px] rounded"
            >COMPLETED</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-outfit">
          Rust Core Engine v1.1
        </h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">
          Axum/Tokio async execution, 10Hz MessagePack WebSocket stream, and
          Sapphire Shield zero-trust HITL gate.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Q2 -->
      <div
        class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-cyan-500/30 space-y-3"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between text-cyan-400 font-bold"
        >
          <span>Q2 2026</span>
          <span
            class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-[10px] rounded"
            >ACTIVE RELEASE</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-outfit">
          Tauri Desktop & GraphRAG
        </h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">
          React + Tauri desktop engine, LanceDB 768-dim vector embeddings,
          and real-time trace waterfall viewer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Q3 -->
      <div
        class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-purple-500/30 space-y-3"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between text-purple-400 font-bold"
        >
          <span>Q3 2026</span>
          <span
            class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-[10px] rounded"
            >UPCOMING</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-outfit">
          Multi-Node Mesh Swarms
        </h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">
          Distributed local mesh networking across multi-GPU hardware nodes
          with PWA offline whitepaper vault.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Q4 -->
      <div
        class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950 border border-amber-500/30 space-y-3"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between text-amber-400 font-bold"
        >
          <span>Q4 2026</span>
          <span
            class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-[10px] rounded"
            >PLANNED</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-outfit">
          Autonomous Enterprise Cluster
        </h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">
          Audit-oriented records mapped to ISO 9001 and ALCOA+ concepts,
          OBLITERATUS Merkle proofs, and an enterprise cluster manager.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
